<script setup>
import { computed } from 'vue';import { useRoute,useRouter } from 'vue-router';import { studio,sessionPath } from '../store.js';import Icon from '../components/Icon.vue';const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter();const s=computed(()=>studio.state.value.sessions.find(x=>x.id===route.params.sessionId));function start(){router.push(s.value.status==='completed'||s.value.answers.length?sessionPath(s.value):`/interviews/${s.value.id}/device`)}
</script>
<template><template v-if="s"><div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / YOUR PLAN</p><h1>这场练习，为你准备好了。</h1><p class="muted">{{s.roleName}} · {{s.level}} · {{s.mode==='coaching'?'陪练模式':'模拟模式'}}<span v-if="s.focusTopic"> · 专项再测：{{s.focusTopic}}</span></p></div><span class="badge">演示方案</span></div><div class="two-col"><section class="card"><h2>面试路线</h2><ol class="timeline"><li v-for="(q,i) in s.questions.filter(x=>!x.isFollowup)" :key="q.id"><span>{{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}}</span><div><h3>{{q.stage}}</h3><p>{{q.topic}}</p></div></li></ol><p class="notice">共 {{s.mainCount}} 道主问题，回答后追加一次追问。练习可暂停，进度和草稿自动保留。</p></section><section class="card"><h2>本次面试依据</h2><h3>岗位要求</h3><p class="preserve">{{s.context.jd}}</p><h3>项目经历</h3><p class="preserve muted">{{s.context.resume||'未提供经历，将使用岗位通用问题。'}}</p><div class="tags"><span v-for="skill in s.context.roleSkills" :key="skill">{{skill}}</span></div><p class="notice">Demo 使用预设题库。评分仅用于展示闭环，不代表实际招聘评价。</p></section></div><div class="action-bar"><RouterLink to="/interviews/new" class="button secondary">重新准备</RouterLink><button class="button primary" @click="start">{{s.status==='completed'?'查看报告':s.answers.length?'继续面试':'准备好了，开始面试'}} <Icon name="right"/></button></div></template><section v-else class="card empty"><h1>这份方案不存在</h1><RouterLink to="/interviews">返回面试记录</RouterLink></section></template>
